From: AlexanderNyr <131390634+AlexanderNyr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:24:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2 - docs + tools: api docs (GRAPH, UNIFORMS, BIOME),
 packlint, drift-check

docs/api/ now covers the whole public surface: RHI, PACK_FORMAT, GRAPH,
UNIFORMS, BIOME. tools/packlint exposes the loader's refusals as a CLI
(exit 1 on error, warnings on stderr, --strict promotes, --null-device
checks capabilities). tools/drift-check replays the host gate and fails
when a suite number moves without its doc line.
